  "definition": {
    "en": "Esko Automation Engine — comprehensive workflow automation for packaging and label printing, covering preflight, color management, step-and-repeat, prepress, and proofing.",
    "nb": "Esko Automation Engine — omfattende arbeidsflyt-automasjon for emballasje- og etikettrykk, dekker preflight, fargestyring, step-and-repeat, prepress og proofing.",
    "de": "Esko Automation Engine — umfassende Workflow-Automatisierung für Verpackungs- und Etikettendruck, abdeckend Preflight, Farbmanagement, Step-and-Repeat, Druckvorstufe und Proofing.",
    "ja": "Esko Automation Engine — パッケージおよびラベル印刷向けの包括的なワークフロー自動化。プリフライト、カラーマネジメント、ステップアンドリピート、製版、校正をカバーする。",
    "es": "Motor de automatización de Esko orientado a packaging y etiquetas, con integración profunda con ArtPro+ y WebCenter.",
    "zh-Hans": "Esko面向包装和标签的自动化引擎，与ArtPro+和WebCenter深度集成。",
    "sv": "Esko Automation Engine — omfattande arbetsflödesautomation för förpacknings- och etikettryck, täcker preflight, färghantering, step-and-repeat, prepress och provtryck.",
    "da": "Esko Automation Engine — omfattende workflow-automatisering til emballage- og etikettryk, der dækker preflight, farvestyring, step-and-repeat, prepress og prøvetryk.",
    "nl": "Esko Automation Engine — veelomvattende workflowautomatisering voor verpakkings- en etikettendruk, met preflight, kleurbeheer, step-and-repeat, prepress en proeven.",
    "pl": "Esko Automation Engine — kompleksowa automatyzacja workflow dla druku opakowań i etykiet, obejmująca preflight, zarządzanie barwą, step-and-repeat, prepress i proofing.",
    "pt": "Esko Automation Engine — automação abrangente de fluxo de trabalho para impressão de embalagens e rótulos, cobrindo preflight, gerenciamento de cor, step-and-repeat, pré-impressão e provas.",
    "hi": "Esko Automation Engine — पैकेजिंग और लेबल प्रिंटिंग के लिए व्यापक वर्कफ़्लो स्वचालन, प्रीफ़्लाइट, रंग प्रबंधन, स्टेप-एंड-रिपीट, प्रीप्रेस और प्रूफ़िंग को ढकता है।"
  },
  "creator": "https://ptpge.org/contributors/ptpge",
  "contributor": [
    "https://ptpge.org/contributors/patrik-knutsson"
  ],
  "deprecatedOn": "2026-10-06",
  "replacedBy": "https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/management/workflow/efficiency-tools/automation-integration",
  "deprecationReason": {
    "en": "A brand is a term only when the trade uses it as a standard, never when it is a product one buys (SD-0097). This is a product: it belongs in the maker's supplier catalogue and in a printer's vendor declaration as capability. Use the generic parent in the vocabulary; this URI keeps resolving.",
    "nb": "Et merke er en term bare når bransjen bruker det som en standard, aldri når det er et produkt man kjøper (SD-0097). Dette er et produkt: det hører hjemme i produsentens katalog og i trykkeriets leverandørdeklarasjon som kapasitet. Bruk den generiske forelderen i vokabularet; denne URI-en fortsetter å svare."
  }
}
